OL,3,GNEWSACalls for residents to shape Town
OL,4,Aof Culture bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FCorby residents have until the end of
OL,7,FNovember to help shape its bid to
OL,8,Fbecome UK Town of Culture 2028.
OL,10,FIt is on a shortlist of five in the
OL,11,Fmedium-sized towns category of the
OL,12,Fcompetition, being held for the first
OL,13,Ftime.
OL,15,FThe winner will get #3m to deliver a
OL,16,Fsix-month programme of cultural events.
OL,17,FTwo other finalists will each receive
OL,18,F#250,000.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
