OL,3,GNEWSACalls for residents to shape Town
OL,4,Aof Culture bid
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is very much the people's bid and
OL,7,Fwe want to hear from people about the
OL,8,F[parts of Corby] they love. Having
OL,9,Feveryone involved is brilliant," said
OL,10,FEmily Askew, marketing consultant for
OL,11,FCorby's bid.
